     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Poder» / «dever» + «ter» + participle",
     "texto": [
      "To suppose something about the past: **Pode ter sido ele** (it may have been him). **Deve ter chegado** (he must have arrived). With **ter** + participle, the past of the supposition."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Seria» (conditional)",
     "texto": [
      "For a past supposition with doubt, use the conditional: **Seria o Miguel** (could it be Miguel). It's more cautious."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
